msgstr "Configuración avanzada de servidor"

#: startupwizard.cpp:350
msgid "Please set at least your name and email address."
msgstr "Por favor, estableza polo menos o seu nome e enderezo de correo."

#: startupwizard.cpp:364
msgid ""
"If the groupware server is a kolab server with default settings, you only "
"need to set these settings."
msgstr "S"

#: startupwizard.cpp:379
msgid ""
"If you want, you can create new accounts before going on with groupware "
"configuration."
msgstr ""
"Se vostede quere, pode crear novas contas antes de ir á configuración de "
"groupware."

#: startupwizard.cpp:395
msgid ""
"If you want to make your groupware folders work with other applications, you "
"might want to select a different language than English."
"<br>If this is not an issue, leave the language as is."
msgstr ""
"Se quere que os cartafois groupware funcionen con outras aplicacións, "
"podería querer escoller unha lingua diferente ca o inglés."
"<br>Se isto non supón un problema, deixe a lingua como está."

#: startupwizard.cpp:422
msgid ""
"The groupware functionality needs some special folders to store the contents "
"of the calendar, contacts, tasks etc."
"<br>"
"Please select the folder that the groupware folders should be subfolders of."
msgstr ""
"A funcionalidade groupware precisa algúns cartafois especiais para gardar "
"os contidos do calendario, os contactos, as tarefas, etc."
"<br> Por favor, escolla o cartafol do cal os cartafois groupware deben ser "
"subcartafois."

#: startupwizard.cpp:438
msgid "<unnamed>"
msgstr "<sen nome>"

#: startupwizard.cpp:441
msgid ""
"You have chosen the folder <b>%1</b> as parent of the groupware folders. "
"When pressing the Finish button, those folders will be created if they do "
"not already exist"
msgstr ""
"Escolleu o cartafol <b>%1</b> coma pai dos cartafois groupware. Cando se "
"prema o botón Rematar, estes cartafois crearanse se aínda non existen."

#: startupwizard.cpp:451
msgid ""
"The folders present indicates that you want to use the selected folder "
"language"
msgstr ""
